# RR2e (critical_qualifier_receivers_bug; steps/qualifier-receivers-20261010.md): the qualifier chain over an EXISTING
# value -- a named Structure, not a construction -- is RuntimeImmutable's operation (docs #qualification), which the
# translator does not build: a located refusal naming the operation, in a method.
Integer:
    int: value 7
end: Integer
fn: m () int
    a: independent: const: immutable: Integer
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
